# vhs tape: tui — run `just record` after `just demo-up`
Output docs/demo/tui.gif
Set Shell fish
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "nfctl tui"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "j"
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 5s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
